{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43379","headline":"赠妓茂英 · 洛中举子","name":"赠妓茂英","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆昔当初过柳楼，茂英年小尚娇羞。\n隔窗未省闻高语，对镜曾窥学上头。\n一别中原俱老大，再来南国见风流。\n弹弦酌酒话前事，零落碧云生暮愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"洛中举子","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43379.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43379","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}